SDL-E1033 (spec/index.md)

  x unknown distance `cosin` — did you mean `cosine`?
   ,----
 1 | index hnsw v { on: t; fields: a; dimension: 8; distance: cosin; };
   :                                            ^^^^^^^|^^^^^^^
   :                                                   `-- not a distance keyword
   `----
  help: distances are `euclidean`, `cosine`, `cosine_normalized`, `chebyshev`, `hamming`, `jaccard`, `pearson`, `inner_product`, `manhattan`, or `minkowski(<order>)` — only minkowski takes an
        argument
